codex
A final schema audit caught one subtle verifier issue: JSON `5.0` compared equal to integer power `5`, so it was accepted despite being outside the declared exact-symbolic language. The checker now requires an actual non-boolean integer. Because the instructions require G1 to be rerun after every change, I’m rerunning the complete suite once more and will freeze that run’s measurements.
exec
