The family generates primary components of tensor-binomial ideal powers using Lemmas 2.4 and 3.1 of the paper. All nine local gates pass, including:

- Exact guess probability: \(1.8204\times10^{-7}\)
- Random guesses: 0/200,000
- Four attacks: 0/8 each
- Reference algorithm: 8/8, about 18.4 million operations
- Answer: 96 characters, 17 atoms
- Full intended route: 296 operations

